WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.890
I heard everything from Sawatari...

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:07.990
I'll fight, carrying on the feelings 
of my allies that you've beaten!

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:10.570
Looks like all the people turned 
into cards are coming back.

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:13.230
There's no way you can't come back, too!

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:16.240
I'm going to return you to normal,

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.830
and throw this back in your face!

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:22.000
Ridiculous!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.310
To destroy this world, I became 
one with my monsters.

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:31.280
I would never give up this immense power.

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:34.690
I will never go back to the way I was!

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:37.900
When a monster is destroyed in battle,

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:41.690
I can Special Summon up to 
two Supreme King Dragons

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:43.490
from my Extra Deck, in defense position!

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:47.160
Be reborn, Supreme King Dragon Darkwurms!

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.370
And I set three cards and end my turn.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:01.960
Now... Come, new duelists.

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:04.430
My destruction of this world

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:06.780
will be the ultimate entertainment.

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:10.630
If you think you can stop it, then try!

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:15.720
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:19.390
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:23.290
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:26.650
almost as if seeking one another.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:05.030
Eyes Stained in Darkness

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:10.120
Four cards?

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:11.940
You mean...

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:13.390
Yes.

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:16.210
The four cards that Leo Akaba tried to use...

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:20.730
The cards Ray Akaba used to defeat Z-ARC!

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:22.910
Ray is saying,

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:25.590
"Father will use those four cards

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:28.970
to try and fight the Supreme King himself!"

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:30.800
Brother,

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:34.360
you can't say goodbye to Father, 
without making peace with him!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.010
If something happened to him, I...

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:41.080
I want everyone to smile!

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:44.640
If we save everyone at Father's expense,

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:46.840
you won't be able to smile!

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:50.260
Smile? Me?

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.430
That's right.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:56.100
Smiles cannot be produced from 
the sadness of another.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.850
Listen, Layra... Stay right here!

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:01.520
Brother!

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:07.920
Destroy the world?! That's no entertainment!

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:09.160
Real entertainment exists...

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.660
...to make everyone smile!

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:12.660
Let's go!

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:14.970
My turn!

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:17.310
Hey, he beat me to it...

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:18.670
Damn!

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:19.950
That's right.

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:23.380
This is something you taught me, Yuya!

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:26.310
That food for children's bellies is important,

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:29.710
but smiles are just as important.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:34.290
I summon Tuner Monster Blackwing 
— Kochi the Daybreak!

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:39.680
When only one Blackwing is on the field,

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:43.730
I can Special Summon Blackwing — Gladius
 the Midnight Sun from my hand!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.810
In City, where I was born and raised,

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:51.310
Tops and Commons hated each other.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:55.910
But your entertainment duel with 
Jack changed the whole world.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.110
You brought back true peace!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:01.350
I'm grateful to you, Yuya!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:04.760
Someone who taught me the 
power of entertainment...

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:09.090
Someone like you would never destroy the world!

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:16.010
Level 3 Kochi the Daybreak tunes 
Level 4 Gladius the Midnight Sun!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.190
Spread your ebony wings,

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:23.340
and strike the ground with the speed of lightning!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:25.840
Synchro Summon!

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:30.120
Rain down, Assault Blackwing — 
Raikiri the Rain Shower!

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:31.810
It's here!

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.510
Crow's ace monster!

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:34.730
No...

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:38.220
As long as Supreme King Z-ARC is on 
the field, if he Synchro Summons...

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:40.190
...he'll just Synchro again.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:44.750
I tribute the two Supreme King Dragon 
Darkwurms on my field,

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.660
to Synchro Summon!

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:52.120
Retainer of mine, with wings of light, 
strike the enemy with your keen wings!

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.330
Synchro Summon!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:58.520
Appear, Supreme King Dragon Clear Wing!

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:03.630
When Supreme King Dragon 
Clear Wing is summoned,

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:07.780
I negate all attacks from your 
monsters, and destroy them!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:14.150
Raikiri was—

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.070
I'm not done yet!

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:19.560
I activate Quick-Play Spell Black 
Feather Illusion from my hand!

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:24.870
I Special Summon Raikiri from my 
graveyard, with its effect negated!

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:31.600
This is my entertainment!

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:36.040
It's back!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.480
Let's go, Yuya.

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:38.480
Battle.

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:41.680
Raikiri attacks Clear Wing!

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:47.890
Clear Wing will activate its effect that negates
 battle and destroys the monster.

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:51.210
Sorry, but your entertainment is over.

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.560
But it isn't over at all.

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:04.840
I activate Quick-Play Spell Black 
Feather Reversal from my hand!

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:10.430
When battle or effect damage is dealt,

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:15.850
I can negate it and Special Summon 
a Blackwing, from my Extra Deck,

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:18.320
with the same number of attack points!

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:22.120
Come, Assault Blackwing — 
Chidori the Rain Sprinkling!

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:25.130
For each Blackwing in my graveyard,

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:29.480
Chidori the Rain Sprinkling's 
attack points increase by 300!

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:33.130
Let's go!

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:36.170
Chidori the Rain Sprinkling attacks Clear Wing!

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:43.140
Yeah!

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:47.000
I praise you for destroying my monster.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:50.120
But Supreme King Gate 
Zero's effect means that

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:54.590
if a Supreme King Monster is on 
my field, I take 0 damage.

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:56.110
Is that what you think?

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:59.760
I banish Black Feather Illusion from my graveyard,

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.300
to activate its effect!

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:05.630
I negate spell effects during this battle.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:08.730
You take 1000 points of damage!

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:13.340
Wow. He hit him.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:17.260
He sealed Supreme King Gate's effect 
and dealt damage to Z-ARC.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.730
This is your entertainment?

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:26.420
Then, I will amuse you with my entertainment!

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:29.820
I activate Continuous Trap Supreme Faceoff,

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.620
targeting your Chidori the Rain Sprinkling!

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:36.960
This forces Chidori to attack once more!

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:39.770
Once more? But the only opponent left...

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:41.100
...is Z-ARC himself!

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:42.930
But with Chidori's attack points...

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:44.040
...he can't keep up.

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:56.220
When I destroy a monster,

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:58.880
I can Special Summon two Supreme King monsters

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.260
from my Extra Deck, in defense position.

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:03.800
Be reborn, Darkwurms!

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.800
It isn't only your monsters that come back.

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:10.130
When Chidori the Rain Sprinkling is destroyed,

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:13.330
I can Special Summon Raikiri the 
Rain Shower from my graveyard!

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:18.320
I activate Raikiri's effect.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:22.460
Once per turn, for each Blackwing 
on my side of the field,

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:24.280
I can destroy one of your cards!

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:27.150
I cannot be affected by the effects of Fusion, Xyz,

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:30.010
or, of course, Synchro Monsters!

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.750
Are you that afraid of losing?

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:37.320
It's true that in a duel, winning is best.

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:41.360
But someone who doesn't know 
losing's pain and sorrow

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:44.130
can't appreciate the true joy of winning.

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:47.770
We Commons were always losing.

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:52.100
That's what made the joy of 
restoring peace to City so great.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.250
Don't forget, Yuya...

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:56.070
You're the one who did that!

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:59.390
Shut up! I do not lose!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:04.060
Hey, you got him so annoyed 
that he had to deny it.

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:06.480
There's no shame in losing.

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:11.260
The only shame is being so afraid of 
losing that you end up living a lie.

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:16.430
I use Raikiri's effect to destroy Supreme Faceoff.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:24.960
Once per turn, Supreme Faceoff's effect

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:27.440
prevents a Supreme King card's destruction!

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:31.880
When you're all balled up and tense, 
you can't make anyone smile.

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:35.610
But I feel like your mask is slipping, just a little.

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:39.530
I now end my turn.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.790
The rest is up to you, Sawatari.

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:44.260
You leave it to me.

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:47.490
Well, I guess the lead actor's taking the stage.

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:50.190
The fun is only getting started!

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:52.430
What's going on here?

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:55.630
Where's Yuya?

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.590
You think Yuzu's in that world, too?

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.340
Are you okay, Yuzu?!

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:04.030
I'm going to make you remember, Yuya...

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:06.310
What true entertainment looks like!

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:08.680
My turn!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:16.320
I set the Pendulum Scale

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:21.320
with Scale 1 Evil Heel and 
Scale 8 Funky Comedian!

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:27.170
I can now summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:28.870
Pendulum Summon!

00:11:31.360 --> 00:11:34.610
Appear, Abyss Actor Superstar!

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:36.840
And Wild Hope!

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:39.280
And last, Leading Lady.

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:42.590
See? This is my all-star cast.

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:44.320
And the real show—

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:48.520
First, let me call my own cast to the stage.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.990
The dragon worthy of the name "Pendulum."

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:51.690
What?

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:52.920
This time, can it be...

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:57.580
When my opponent Pendulum Summons 
a Pendulum Monster to the field,

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:02.240
I can tribute two Supreme King 
Dragons, to Special Summon

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:06.520
a Pendulum Monster from my 
hand, deck, or Extra Deck.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:10.320
Vassal with different-colored eyes,

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:14.440
use your two sharp eyes to burn our enemies!

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:17.850
Appear, Supreme King Dragon Odd-Eyes!

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:19.500
That's Odd-Eyes!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:22.010
What's Yuya's dragon doing there?

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.310
No, that isn't it.

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:24.840
It looks like it, but...

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:28.090
What is that giant monster?

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:31.080
Does it have some connection to Yuya?

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:34.200
Pendulum against Pendulum, eh?

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:36.300
I see you're getting it, Yuya.

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:38.460
The players are on the stage.

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:42.040
Superstar's effect lets me add a spell 
card from my deck to my hand.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:45.510
Abyss Script — Rise of the Abyss King.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:49.150
When a card is added to a hand during 
a phase other than the Draw Phase,

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:51.750
my own effect destroys it!

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:57.460
You really must be scared, huh?

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:59.160
Be silent!

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:05.260
Then, I activate my Continuous Spell Abyss 
Script — Abysstainment from my hand!

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.460
I tribute Leading Lady

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:11.930
to recall Abyss Script — Rise of the 
Abyss King from my graveyard,

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.180
and set it.

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:17.110
I didn't add it to my hand, see?

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:19.480
So you can't destroy it with your power...

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:24.550
And I activate Rise of the Abyss King!

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:29.350
I destroy as many of your cards as 
I have Abyss Actors on the field.

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:31.490
In other words, two!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:36.730
I destroy Supreme King Z-ARC and 
Supreme King Dragon Odd-Eyes!

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:39.960
Continuous Trap Supreme Faceoff's effect prevents

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.930
Supreme King cards from 
being destroyed on my field.

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:44.140
That won't work.

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:50.680
When I have an Abyss Actor monster, 
Level 7 or above, on my field,

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:55.650
you can't activate effects that target
Rise of the Abyss King's activation.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:58.120
Die, alongside Odd-Eyes!

00:13:58.120 --> 00:13:58.820
Will he...

00:13:58.820 --> 00:13:59.790
finally defeat...

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:00.720
...Z-ARC?

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:04.840
Yes!

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:06.520
I'm just so great.

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:09.190
Z-ARC, Supreme King, whatever you are, I—

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:14.460
As long as Supreme King Dragon 
Odd-Eyes is on the field,

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:19.070
I can prevent the destruction of a Pendulum
 card, once on each of our turns.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:26.740
I am Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, and Pendulum, too!

00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:30.450
Did Yuya's Odd-Eyes just 
protect that giant monster?

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:33.900
I told you, that isn't Yuya's dragon!

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:35.730
But it looks the same.

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:37.420
They must be connected.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:42.370
You're pathetic, Yuya!

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.510
The Yuya Sakaki I knew

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:48.130
wasn't a coward that fortified his defenses that much.

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:49.320
Right?

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:53.000
Even during the legendary duel we fought,

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:58.010
you performed your Big Escape, 
regardless of the danger.

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:00.110
What happened to that courage?

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:03.560
If you've forgotten it, I'll remind you!

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:05.280
As many times as it takes!

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:09.580
The effect of Continuous Spell 
Abyss Script — Abysstainment

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.790
lets me tribute Wild Hope,

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:15.560
to call back Abyss Script — Rise of the 
Abyss King from my graveyard

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.630
and activate it!

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:21.400
And with its effect, I destroy 
Supreme King Z-ARC!

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:27.810
As long as Sawatari has his Level 7 Superstar,

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:30.680
Z-ARC can't activate Supreme Faceoff.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:36.150
And he can only use Odd-Eyes's effect once.

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:40.420
I will not be destroyed.

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:47.260
Yes, I will never be destroyed.

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:53.000
Not as long as monsters I destroyed 
are in your graveyard.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:54.370
What?

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:56.140
Destroyed by him?

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.700
Our monsters...

00:15:58.040 --> 00:15:59.720
What are they doing in his body?

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:02.910
Our monsters are protecting him.

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:07.110
Then, what have we been fighting for?

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:10.870
Damn... At this rate...

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:14.220
Your efforts have not been in vain.

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:19.120
Professor!

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:19.860
What?

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:26.260
That man is...

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:27.970
Leo Akaba?

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.920
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:33.860
Leo Akaba?

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.330
Wh-What?

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:41.020
Wh-What's going on?

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.710
Wh-What's happening here?

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:57.440
We're back again...

00:16:57.440 --> 00:16:58.880
Look at that!

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:01.050
Our friends from the Resistance...

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:05.000
I thought they were turned into cards.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.600
Are they back to normal?

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:11.960
What the heck is going on?!

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:15.880
Z-ARC, do you remember me?

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.320
Yes, I do remember.

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:22.250
You are the man who gave monsters real bodies,

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:24.730
urged their souls to awaken,

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.720
and revolutionized dueling.

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:33.130
That's right. Monsters, having gained 
substance with Real Solid Vision,

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:35.130
truly did cause a revolution.

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:40.340
People sought fiercer, more stimulating duels.

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:44.820
And duelists fought those more stimulating duels.

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:47.310
And in the end, Z-ARC,

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:50.490
that produced the devil that was you.

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:54.590
Z-ARC! Z-ARC! Z-ARC! Z-ARC!

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:55.880
That's right.

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:59.840
Amidst those cheers, I swore...

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:04.610
I would become stronger and 
more ferocious than anyone!

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:07.930
I would sweep aside all the enemies 
that stood before me,

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:11.110
and fight until the world was destroyed!

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:13.260
That vow

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:15.770
has not changed!

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:19.810
I send Supreme Faceoff to the graveyard 
to activate its effect.

00:18:19.810 --> 00:18:23.010
I force your monsters to fight!

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:24.010
Wait!

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:25.250
Don't just run off!

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:49.800
Don't relax yet!

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:54.040
Supreme King Dragon Odd-Eyes's 
effect doubles the damage dealt!

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:09.200
If you will stand in my way, 
I'll sweep you away, too.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:11.010
You will not.

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:14.370
I know the way to beat you.

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:15.900
Those cards?

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:18.100
What? What cards?

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:20.920
As you were torn apart, on that day,

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:25.540
in your suffering, you tore the world 
into four dimensions, as well.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:31.750
This time, in Ray's place, I will defeat 
you and remake the world.

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:33.580
In Ray's place?

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:35.160
My turn.

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:40.010
I activate my spell card Spirit Collapse.

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:42.010
I pay 1000 life points

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:47.290
to send Fusion Monster Master Spirit 
Tech Force — Pendulum Ruler

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:48.740
from my Extra Deck to the graveyard.

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:56.620
Why is he adding more monsters to the graveyard?

00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:00.580
He's just firming up Z-ARC's defenses...

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:04.560
As the one who created this devil...

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:08.680
As the one who threw the world into 
chaos by splitting the dimensions,

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.240
I must take responsibility.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:14.560
The responsibility for that devil's creation 
doesn't rest with you alone!

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:15.530
Reiji?

00:20:15.910 --> 00:20:18.730
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:20.700
Reiji?

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:24.400
I also bear responsibility for the 
Supreme King Z-ARC's revival.

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.950
You are going to fight at my side?

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:29.930
Three Fusion Monsters are in the graveyard.

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:32.410
All of the conditions are now met.

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:34.970
Let us begin, Z-ARC!

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:38.050
I will not let you have your way!

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:40.520
I activate my trap Supreme Disdain!

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:44.350
For each Supreme King card I have 
on the field, excluding this one,

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:49.230
in other words, four, I can pick one card 
from your hand and destroy it!

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:51.460
What? A person is in there!

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:53.430
Where?

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.420
That's...

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:58.600
Yuya?

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:01.480
Z-ARC is that monster, isn't it?

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:03.540
You mean, Z-ARC is Yuya?

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:09.030
Z-ARC was produced from the evil 
that exists within each of us.

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:12.490
In other words, society created 
the monster called Z-ARC.

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:16.760
We must bear that sin together.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:21.960
These are the four cards I destroy 
with Supreme Disdain!

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:35.040
For every card destroyed, I deal 
300 points of damage to you.

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:37.940
Away with you and your four cards!

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:43.710
Father!

00:21:59.860 --> 00:22:02.170
A-Are you...

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:06.300
Ray?

00:23:48.070 --> 00:23:50.040
Z-ARC is currently using Pendulum.

00:23:50.560 --> 00:23:53.510
That's the proof that Yuya's soul still exists.

00:23:54.240 --> 00:23:56.250
He's completely different from the previous Z-ARC.

00:23:56.970 --> 00:23:59.450
The one who invented Pendulum Summon, Yuya...

00:23:59.450 --> 00:24:00.720
It's you!

00:24:00.720 --> 00:24:02.340
Reiji Akaba,

00:24:02.340 --> 00:24:04.720
you seem to be under a tremendous misapprehension.

00:24:05.240 --> 00:24:10.360
Supreme King Z-ARC is Pendulum's true founder!

00:24:10.770 --> 00:24:14.960
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Soul's Pendulum.

00:24:14.960 --> 00:24:17.080
The fun is only getting started!
